{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 1000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yomojomo of Didi and Jeong Tae-woong's Life in Korea"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hello, this is Didi."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 11000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hello, this is Jeong Tae-woong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 13000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yomojomo of life in Korea is a podcast where two people living in Korea talk about the various aspects of life in Korea."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Last week we met offline and talked, so how was your trip to Busan?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 28000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, I went and came back."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As soon as I arrived, I went to a kimbap restaurant in front of my house and ate a bowl of cheese ramen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That sounds delicious."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, and when I got home like that, it really felt like I had come back."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is it a ramen place you go to often? A kimbap restaurant?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No, because the taste wasn't good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Really? What do you mean?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 49000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At that time it probably tasted good. You must have been hungry."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 52000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right. When you're hungry enough to eat anything, places like that seem"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 56000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "pretty decent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right. I have one announcement."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 61000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Until now, Tae-woong has been coming on Yomojomo every week like this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but now I'm going to be adding other programs,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 71000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so I'm thinking of making Yomojomo maybe once every three weeks or once a month instead."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 78000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I really want to thank Tae-woong for coming on every week until now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No, I should be the one thanking you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No, that's not it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 87000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And though it's not a lot, I'm really grateful to the subscribers who like Yomojomo."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 93000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No, there are a lot. There are a lot, I'm telling you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 97000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's modest, but more and more people are listening little by little."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 101000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On Spotify and YouTube too, I'm really, really grateful."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 105000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So first, before we start today, I got a question for Tae-woong,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 112000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I'm going to read it for you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 115000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For me?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 116000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. It's a question for Tae-woong, and someone asked me through Instagram DM."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 121000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The ID seems to be read as either Gian or Jui-an,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they're asking what your Instagram ID \"Vivo Estas Bonas\" means,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 135000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and this person says they speak Spanish."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 137000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It seems like it has kind of unusual grammar, something like \"you are alive,\" and they're asking if that's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 145000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is it right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 146000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My Instagram ID Vivo Estas Bonas is not Spanish,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 153000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's Esperanto."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 157000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All of a sudden?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 160000,
    "dDurationMs": 9000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's an artificial language created by Dr. Zamenhof from Poland."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a language that was artificially created by a person."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 173000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's not a script, it's a language."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that doctor created this language so that all humans on Earth would use it as a common language for all humanity,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 184000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a language that all people would use together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 188000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is it old? How long ago was it made?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 190000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's probably quite old."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 192000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So there are people who speak that language scattered around the world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 200000,
    "dDurationMs": 10000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I happened to learn about that language too, and I thought it was really fascinating."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 210000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So at one point I tried to learn it a bit,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 215000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and my ID Vivo Estas Bonas is in Esperanto,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 219000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what does it mean?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 220000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It means \"Life is good.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 224000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Life is good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 226000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Life is a good thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 228000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Since life is good, let's live joyfully."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 231000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 233000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you use it as a universal human language, it sounds cool."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 240000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right. If people all over the world know that language, they would all understand that word."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 248000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 250000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With that intention, then?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 252000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 253000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's what they say."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 255000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's really similar to Spanish."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 257000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. It's quite similar."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 259000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's interesting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 261000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was surprised when you suddenly said you had a question."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 265000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You're catching me off guard like this every week."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 268000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So now let's get back to introducing the Yomojomo theme properly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 273000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What's this week's topic?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. This week's topic is \"natkkarim\" (being shy with strangers)."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 279000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So Tae-woong suggested this topic last week."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 284000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I wonder if there's a reason you suggested it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 287000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We met in person for the first time last week, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 293000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 295000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I was wondering if you felt shy or not."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 302000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whether your shyness kicked in or not?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 304000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 305000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How was it? Do you think you're usually someone who feels shy around strangers? Yourself?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 310000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These days I don't think I do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 314000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These days?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 316000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 318000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Until when did you feel shy?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 320000,
    "dDurationMs": 9000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think until around twenty, twenty-one? So I felt shy a lot in my early twenties."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 329000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 330000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 331000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But did you get over it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 334000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 335000,
    "dDurationMs": 10000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As I was forced to meet many different people and had to stand in front of people,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 346000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and had to talk to strangers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 349000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "after having many experiences like that, my shyness went away."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 354000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Before I ask what kind of person you are, Didi,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 358000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm not sure if the word \"natkkarim\" might be difficult."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 364000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think \"natkkarim\" has several types,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 370000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and when I think about it, when you meet a stranger,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 375000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can't show yourself well,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 377000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can't express your opinions well,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 380000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and there's also some embarrassment,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 384000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and your words don't come out well, those kinds of symptoms, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 389000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I think there might be a corresponding word for this in your country too,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 395000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and when I always try to express in English that I feel shy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 401000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it comes out as \"I'm shy with strangers.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 404000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's very intuitive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 406000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. So in that sense, when you meet strangers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 410000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "new people, it seems like you get embarrassed or can't speak well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 418000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At this point, most of you would understand what it means, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 422000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You would."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 424000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But actually, even though I had shyness,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 429000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I heard the word \"natkkarim\" quite late."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 434000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 436000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 437000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is that a Seoul dialect?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 439000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm not sure. Me neither."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 440000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is it not used much in Busan?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 442000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But strangely, no one ever told me \"you're shy\" or anything like that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 448000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and from that I can understand one thing:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 452000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to someone who really is shy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 454000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 455000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's difficult to say \"you're shy like that\"?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 459000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh right. Usually people say it themselves. I feel shy, that kind of way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 465000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 467000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So Didi, do you have shyness around strangers now?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 472000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I do tend to be shy around unfamiliar people,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 478000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and back then I started to understand better when I was being shy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 486000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example, I think it's when I want to look good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 490000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When I have the thought that I want someone to see me in a good light, that's when I seem to get shy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 497000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 498000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because of that pressure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 500000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 501000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, I felt that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 504000,
    "dDurationMs": 9000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Actually, I was planning to bring this up later when we talk about tips for overcoming shyness."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 513000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 514000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 515000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Would you like to share the tips first then?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 517000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That, just like you said earlier, Didi,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 520000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 521000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when you think something is important and get tense, you can't help but become shy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 528000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 529000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what should you do?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 531000,
    "dDurationMs": 9000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You just have to not regard that moment and that person as important."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 540000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But that's the hard part."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 543000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This person is nothing special."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 545000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 546000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They're not important to me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 547000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mind control."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 548000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 550000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh but I think that could actually be a useful tip."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 553000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 554000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because rather than constantly thinking about how I am,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 557000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so instead of thinking I have to look good,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 561000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "instead of thinking I have to be perfect,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 563000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "thinking that the other person is nothing special,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 566000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that might be an easier way to approach it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 570000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh that's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 571000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right, that's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 572000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you try to look good, you become shy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 574000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 575000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because you end up showing a version of yourself that isn't really you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 579000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's true."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 580000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sometimes I go out without even washing my hair."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 584000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's important."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 585000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 586000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When I'm comfortable like that and there are parts of me that are a bit messy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 592000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "nothing terrible happens."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 594000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 595000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There aren't that many people who are important to me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 598000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 599000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Other people don't think of me that way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 600000,
    "dDurationMs": 10600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When I was studying Japanese, I learned an expression—you know the term \"jack of all trades\"?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 610600,
    "dDurationMs": 12119,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's something called \"jack of all trades syndrome,\" and when I try to be too perfect, I get stressed about it and my true self doesn't come out, so I've been thinking lately that I should build up the courage to let myself be a mess."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 622719,
    "dDurationMs": 14040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's a very good thought."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 636759,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But you said you don't get shy, so even if one-on-one or like three-on-one meetings are fine,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 640119,
    "dDurationMs": 9881,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when you go to a place with a lot of people, you don't feel that sense of shyness?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 650000,
    "dDurationMs": 6119,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't think I feel it anymore."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 656119,
    "dDurationMs": 2121,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That must be comfortable?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 658240,
    "dDurationMs": 1199,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 659439,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm envious."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 661639,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When I think about when that started, there's an English expression like this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 662759,
    "dDurationMs": 8721,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"He knows what he does,\" you know that expression?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 671480,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That person knows what kind of person he is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 674480,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That person knows what kind of person he is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 678080,
    "dDurationMs": 5720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Since I got into that state, that awkwardness has kind of disappeared."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 683800,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I know what I do, you know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 685400,
    "dDurationMs": 2239,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 687639,
    "dDurationMs": 9200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I know what kind of person I am, what kind of thoughts I live with, and so when I meet someone, I can tell them what I do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 696839,
    "dDurationMs": 4201,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "From that point on, it seems like that awkwardness went away."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 701040,
    "dDurationMs": 8960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right. So from the moment you know yourself well and start letting go of the burden about the other person?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 710000,
    "dDurationMs": 4639,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hmm... the shyness around strangers kind of disappeared."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 714639,
    "dDurationMs": 5240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hmm... it must feel really comfortable. Wherever you go."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 719879,
    "dDurationMs": 5640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I actually talked about shyness around strangers on a live stream recently."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 726239,
    "dDurationMs": 8561,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When I was worried about shyness, I was searching online for ways to overcome it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 734800,
    "dDurationMs": 7920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I found this idea that you don't really need to overcome shyness, so I talked about that once."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 742720,
    "dDurationMs": 10199,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Actually, a lot of people think introverted people or people who are shy around strangers are bad or have complexes about it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 752919,
    "dDurationMs": 10000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But ultimately there are advantages to those traits too, so if you use them well, you can go in a different, better direction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 762919,
    "dDurationMs": 2401,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What kind of advantages are there?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 765320,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It seems like people like that tend to have good observation skills."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 769720,
    "dDurationMs": 9600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because they don't show themselves until they've figured out the other person completely."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 779320,
    "dDurationMs": 11359,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So they keep observing their surroundings and trying to understand other people's relationships, and that tendency seems to give them pretty good observation skills."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 790679,
    "dDurationMs": 2401,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wow... you're a dangerous person, aren't you?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 793080,
    "dDurationMs": 880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 793960,
    "dDurationMs": 2319,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In a good way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 796279,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Everyone's being observed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 798919,
    "dDurationMs": 11840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So Didi, aside from whether you have shyness yourself, you must have met people who are shy before, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 810759,
    "dDurationMs": 720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 811479,
    "dDurationMs": 1681,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How was that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 813160,
    "dDurationMs": 9519,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example, when I meet one-on-one with someone quieter than me, someone shyer than me, it actually feels easier for me to talk."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 822679,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 826759,
    "dDurationMs": 7601,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's like when only introverts gather, an extrovert is forcibly created."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 834360,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 835960,
    "dDurationMs": 9679,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I think I told you this before, Didi—when I went to gatherings like that, I said I get shy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 845639,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right. You said you can't talk well?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 847639,
    "dDurationMs": 2081,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. Now that I think about it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 849880,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I figured out the difference."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 851880,
    "dDurationMs": 5679,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Recently when I went up to Seoul for a YouTube event, I wasn't shy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 857559,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 859239,
    "dDurationMs": 961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You weren't shy?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 860200,
    "dDurationMs": 9520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No. But when I thought about what the problem was, it seems I got really shy because I ended up at a gathering with only women."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 869720,
    "dDurationMs": 3519,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But Tae-woong, you're okay talking with women, aren't you?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 873239,
    "dDurationMs": 9921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm okay with it, but if there are 20 women and I'm alone, that's a different problem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 883160,
    "dDurationMs": 3679,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's a situation you can't really experience easily."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 886839,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 887799,
    "dDurationMs": 2401,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "People of a different category from me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 890200,
    "dDurationMs": 3199,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. I see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 893399,
    "dDurationMs": 2321,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then I don't think I'd have anything to say."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 895720,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nothing to talk about."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 897720,
    "dDurationMs": 2799,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I can't join in what they're talking about."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 901239,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like I'm just awkwardly there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 903239,
    "dDurationMs": 641,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 903880,
    "dDurationMs": 799,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That must have been it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 904679,
    "dDurationMs": 4641,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That was my last memory of going to a big gathering back then."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 909320,
    "dDurationMs": 799,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 910119,
    "dDurationMs": 6801,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. Back then I told you, Didi, that I get shy a lot at gatherings like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 916920,
    "dDurationMs": 6479,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now that I think about it, unless it's a special situation like that, it seems I don't get shy much."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 923399,
    "dDurationMs": 10880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I see. So when we met two weeks ago, do you talk online a lot like this and meet often? How about you, Tae-woong?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 934279,
    "dDurationMs": 3041,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's happened a few times."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 937320,
    "dDurationMs": 2239,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How is it each time?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 939559,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Uh... it wasn't that awkward."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 943959,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's not awkward?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 945239,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 946839,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But that doesn't mean it's very comfortable either."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 949239,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's something there, isn't there?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 951880,
    "dDurationMs": 2959,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. There's definitely something different."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 954839,
    "dDurationMs": 1761,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's a strange feeling."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 956600,
    "dDurationMs": 1679,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 958279,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right. It's a fascinating feeling."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 961079,
    "dDurationMs": 3921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's definitely different when you see someone through a screen versus seeing them in person."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 965000,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It feels like meeting a celebrity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 966760,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When I have that kind of feeling, seeing someone on screen and then meeting them in person, that's how it is for me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 970920,
    "dDurationMs": 1039,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 971959,
    "dDurationMs": 7361,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The reason I asked Didi earlier how it feels when you meet someone with different shyness is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 979320,
    "dDurationMs": 880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 980200,
    "dDurationMs": 9599,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sometimes when I'm around someone who's very shy, I feel a bit intimidated."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 989799,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You feel intimidated?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 991079,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are times when I feel intimidated. Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 992679,
    "dDurationMs": 1041,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. Why is that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 993720,
    "dDurationMs": 4639,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you feel intimidated, you lose confidence and your heart becomes a bit weaker, you know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 998359,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 999399,
    "dDurationMs": 5921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, are they not interested in me? Do they dislike me? That kind of thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1005320,
    "dDurationMs": 1039,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The opposite way?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1006359,
    "dDurationMs": 8961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. I keep trying to make the atmosphere better by asking questions and telling various stories, but"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1015320,
    "dDurationMs": 3519,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because the other person is so shy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1018839,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The conversation doesn't work. Then do they dislike me?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1023799,
    "dDurationMs": 2801,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've felt that way sometimes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1026600,
    "dDurationMs": 1199,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1027799,
    "dDurationMs": 5841,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But from those people's perspective, they might feel really sorry too, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1033640,
    "dDurationMs": 4319,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They're probably blaming themselves right now. I can't speak like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1037959,
    "dDurationMs": 2641,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hmm. So?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1040600,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They're probably thinking, this person must be bored with me too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1042600,
    "dDurationMs": 10239,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hmm. So the best thing you can do for them?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1052839,
    "dDurationMs": 1041,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1053880,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Huh? What is it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1056200,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Asking them a lot of questions about them?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1059320,
    "dDurationMs": 639,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1059959,
    "dDurationMs": 2801,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Letting them talk about themselves a bit?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1062760,
    "dDurationMs": 799,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1063559,
    "dDurationMs": 4481,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think that's good. Oh, it might only apply to me though."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1068040,
    "dDurationMs": 1039,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Didi manual."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1069079,
    "dDurationMs": 801,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1069880,
    "dDurationMs": 7840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think shyness comes from not showing yourself well, so"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1077720,
    "dDurationMs": 5839,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there are times when I just keep asking questions. I don't talk much about myself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1083559,
    "dDurationMs": 8321,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So when someone asks me questions too, I gradually start talking more and my heart opens up a bit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1091880,
    "dDurationMs": 7600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh. So you need to make them talk about themselves?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1099480,
    "dDurationMs": 9359,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hmm. But if they seem to struggle with that, sharing my own episode first might be a way too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1108839,
    "dDurationMs": 6001,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hmm. That seems like a really good approach."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1114840,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I hope it works. Just in case."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1117320,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. I think that's a very good conversation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1121159,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A way of speaking that opens the door to someone's heart."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1123159,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1124599,
    "dDurationMs": 8320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When I teach, I'm in the position of listening, so there are times when I don't talk much about myself either, but"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1132919,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "some students ask me about my stories quite often."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1137479,
    "dDurationMs": 3521,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With those people, I definitely feel my heart opening up more."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1141000,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, I see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1142440,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. Like, they accept even these trivial stories from me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1146520,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hmm. Students should take note of that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1151400,
    "dDurationMs": 3839,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Everything is good. My conversations with my students."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1155239,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we talked a bit about shyness today,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1159799,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and now I'm going to add one more segment to Yomojomo and create it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1164679,
    "dDurationMs": 3601,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So let's move on to the next segment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1168520,
    "dDurationMs": 10000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A word-based mini game."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1178520,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This segment is called a word-based mini game,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1182520,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and now the image that comes to mind when I think of Teacher Tae-woong is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1186520,
    "dDurationMs": 6240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On your Comprehensible Input Korean channel, there's an image of you playing games,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1192760,
    "dDurationMs": 4479,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so I prepared a time slot where we can play games in a simple way to match that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1197239,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Since it's a game played with words, I hope you all will watch it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1201000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These are games you can only listen to with your ears."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1204000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So for example, a typical one among Korean games is a game called \"Kkeut-mal-it-gi.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1210000,
    "dDurationMs": 9000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You take turns saying words one by one, and at the end... what do you call it? The last word?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1219000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The last letter?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1220000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You continue by using the last letter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1223000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Since there are games like that, I prepared a different game for each episode."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1229000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What do you think?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1231000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That sounds good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1232000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you think it'll be fun?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1233000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, absolutely."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1235000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I put a lot of effort into planning it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1237000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But what's the benefit of winning?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1239000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The benefit of winning? Do we need something like that to make the game more fun?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1243000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't play games much."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1245000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then let's do it this way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1247000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The loser decides next week's topic?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1252000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That becomes a punishment, though."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1255000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, giving a prize to the winner instead."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1259000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For now, let me think about that a bit more."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1261000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, that sounds good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1263000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's try it by accumulating points."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1266000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the game we're going to play in this episode is a game called \"Twenty Questions.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1272000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you know what kind of game it is?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1274000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Twenty Questions—it's called that because you ask twenty questions,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1278000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and there's a person who poses the problem and a person who solves it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1283000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The person posing the problem thinks of an answer word in their mind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1290000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then the person solving the problem has to figure out what that answer is,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1297000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they can ask up to twenty questions to find out the answer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1301000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1302000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But is it only yes or no?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1305000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right. It's only yes or no. Yes or no."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1308000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah, I see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1310000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you have to guess the correct answer within those twenty questions to win,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1316000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and if you go over, you lose, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1318000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Twenty questions is quite enough to ask a lot of questions,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1323000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but depending on what word you choose, you might not be able to guess it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1329000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's not use words that are too difficult."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1331000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Of course. This is the first game today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1334000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you do something like \"white shark,\" there's no way we'd guess it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1337000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or things like \"Josbar.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1339000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Completely random stuff."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1341000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But since this ends pretty quickly, let's each come up with one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1346000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One each? But what if there are similar words—how do we handle that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1351000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Similar words?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1353000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do we have to be honest about that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1355000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Similar words? What are you trying to do?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1358000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, for example, \"fish\" and \"raw fish.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1362000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1364000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Those basically mean the same thing, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1368000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Fish\" and \"raw fish\"... but \"raw fish\" is..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1372000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, \"raw fish\" is a word used when eating,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1377000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and \"fish\" is a word for something that's alive,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1380000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. Let's distinguish it that precisely."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1383000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even that much?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1384000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because I'm a Korean language expert."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1386000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I understand. That sounds good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1388000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. I was thinking..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1390000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Me too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1391000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let me try to guess first."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1392000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah, okay. Sounds good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1394000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Have you thought of something?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1395000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. The first one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1398000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Can you eat it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1399000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1400000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is it a space?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1402000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1403000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you can't eat it and it's not a space, is it a person?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1406000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1408000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is it an animal?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1409000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1410000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's four questions so far."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1415000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is going to be difficult, isn't it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1417000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Can you see it with your eyes?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1419000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1420000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can see it with your eyes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1423000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Can you touch it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1424000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's correct."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1426000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah, I think I'm not asking good questions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1429000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can touch it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1431000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you see this every day, Tae-woong?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1436000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1438000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Tae-woong sees this every day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1440000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you like this, Tae-woong?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1444000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is it too abstract?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1445000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah, but you can ask questions like this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1447000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1448000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. But I can also answer vaguely."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1451000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1452000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well... a little?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1455000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah, a little?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1457000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1458000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I like it a little."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1460000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1461000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is it also around me?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1463000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know the screen you're looking at?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1465000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is it on the screen?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1468000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It doesn't seem to be there?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1472000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is it an object?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1474000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's correct."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1475000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "An object!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1477000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's an object, you like it a little, and you see it every day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1481000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You like it a little."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1483000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's ten questions now, right? Ten?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1485000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1486000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Halfway there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1487000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is it bigger or smaller than my palm?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1491000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It could be big or it could be small."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1494000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Huh? It could be big or small?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1496000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
